WEBVTT

00:03:00.453 --> 00:03:04.247
Should we then solely rely
on the future improvements

00:03:04.271 --> 00:03:05.928
in the fundamental technology?

00:03:06.794 --> 00:03:08.043
No.

00:03:08.067 --> 00:03:09.299
There is another way.

00:03:09.873 --> 00:03:12.547
And it's the need for
well-thought-through rollouts

00:03:12.571 --> 00:03:15.566
of what might be called CO2 networks.

00:03:16.336 --> 00:03:19.846
In BCG, I lead a team of consultants,

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:22.277
analysts and data scientists

00:03:22.301 --> 00:03:26.965
whose focus is on advancing
carbon capture utilization and storage.

00:03:27.567 --> 00:03:28.783
By our estimates,

00:03:28.807 --> 00:03:30.959
if we want to hit the IEA forecast,